 24px/31px nyt-cheltenham,georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px"><span>Is Putin=E2=
=80=99s Ukraine strategy finally about to pay off=3F</span></h2><p style=3D=
"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>For =
years, the war in Ukraine has effectively been a stalemate. The front has m=
oved at a crawl, and at an appalling cost.</span></p><p style=3D"font:norma=
l 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Western countri=
es remained more or less united in supporting Ukraine against Russia, until=
 Trump returned to office early last year. Since then, American military an=
d financial aid to Ukraine has fallen sharply, shifting much of the burden =
to Europe.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:=
#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Now, another turning point may be at hand.</spa=
n></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0=
 15px"><span>Over the weekend, following his decision to waive some U.S. sa=
nctions and buy Russian diesel, Trump went a step further. </span><a href=
=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newsletter/sFyqvnMGWqux8TV7EYrr2A~~/AAAAARA~/V=
lNmSUwGPSAs4tqLl7JpLFmbWHmS-H2bRKKoGS20wC706cM0MuEIta4c0IG38bgZlVix4fmKVFJ0=
DEWs6XoZ9Y_vOegP3L9OtHAeC-vUR0zjyJz4wp25eC0-phUtKm5obCOS4YhIeACfINsp-jBhoJZ=
paEAnkx9hLz9m0FK-lhLBLsODmEYZ00FR66LuQbneDRgG3wb82oP-GiAhDpHs8aqYFRTuVUbJGT=
HEvBju0xD43BDKWHWciDXvEuvpX8VI7euznjiEsa5xOV82NbW9D_kjoSZjOS5u-m_ucSCvY1qlt=
MmRwiat9u8qgL9KXWOrzu1Q7kxIFSDIc3D8EUk9M9DHqvAw_qcUIzCa-vhMMrfDQxqcFWyp2WiM=
nrNuKh5A" class=3D"css-sdwaa1" style=3D"color:#286ed0;-webkit-text-decorati=
on:underline;text-decoration:underline">As my colleagues report</a><span>, =
he has proposed that European countries resume buying Russian natural gas.<=
/span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin=
:0 0 15px"><span>That idea has been categorically ruled out in many corners=
 of Europe. But not in all of them. Alice Weidel, a leader of the far-right=
 AfD party, told the German Parliament last week that sanctions on Russia w=
ere =E2=80=9Cruining our own economy.=E2=80=9D Marine Le Pen, the leader of=
 France=E2=80=99s far right, </span><a href=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/a/Q=
gfXRPS4cND2s3XhUT2g-A~~/AAAAARA~/JoX5KYiJaX14y3YQ18Szw82-zpFsdMU-5e2_W1WkiQ=
uigml3ytNm2AULWmGAUNoBvdlGs6i2Pp9fyxUjXQcVsds1ej7-4PIP_dtlGQznH8tKgWBzAG1zm=
